    <string name="shizuku_starter_service_description">While it is on, Android treats the controller bridge like an app on screen and closes it last when memory runs short, so the controller does not drop during GeForce NOW. It also presses Shizuku\'s Start button, which cannot receive D-pad focus on Android TV. It sees only Shizuku, and acts there only briefly after you ask it to.</string>
